     - 2: edit_visual_col and edit_visual_to_rune (src/editor.c) use a
       fixed tab stop of 8 (EDIT_TABSTOP); rendering uses
       config.tabsize. Pass the tab size in.
     - 4: tab-indent stepping in cursor_move_single (src/cursor.c)
       indexes a line by rune column as if it were a byte offset.
