       metadata stale.
     - 5, 6 and 8: empty-document clamp, scroll computed as a render side
       effect, ASCII-only word classes.
     Each fix gets a regression test (make test, make test-asan; make
     test-pty for key paths) and a patch bump. Mark each finding fixed in
     the review with its commit.

  2. Open decisions in ROADMAP.md section 9 stay open until Fred decides:
